---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — genckazo" current="about">
  <div class="about">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <p class="lede">The person behind the wardrobe.</p>

    <p>
      Hi, I&rsquo;m <strong>genckazo</strong>. I like quiet interfaces, plain
      text files, e-ink screens, and doors that actually open. By day I work
      with software; by evening I read, mostly on paper or on a screen that
      pretends to be paper.
    </p>
    <p>
      This blog is where I write about the small things: tools, reading,
      design constraints, and whatever I am learning this month. Posts are
      plain Markdown files in
      <a href="https://github.com/genckazo/blog" style="color:var(--link)">the repo</a>,
      so if you spot a typo, a PR is the fastest way to fix it.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can find me on
      <a href="https://github.com/genckazo" style="color:var(--link)">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="sig">&mdash; g.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
